    "directions": [
      "Gently tap and break the top of an egg. Peel away a small, approximately 1/2-inch hole. Empty the contents of the egg. Thoroughly rinse the eggshell and shake out excess water. Let the eggshell air dry upside down in an empty egg carton.",
      "When the eggshells are dry fill with confetti.",
      "Once filled, apply glue around the outside of the hole and cover with tissue paper. Continue covering the egg with glue and tissue paper until the entire shell is covered."
